t the 'HttpOnly' flag by calling 'cookie.setHttpOnly(true);'\n\n<b>References:</b>\n - [Semgrep Rule](https://find-sec-bugs.github.io/bugs.htm#HTTPONLY_COOKIE)\n - [https://owasp.org/Top10/A05_2021-Security_Misconfiguration](https://owasp.org/Top10/A05_2021-Security_Misconfiguration)\n","text":"A cookie was detected without setting the 'HttpOnly' flag. The 'HttpOnly' flag for cookies instructs the browser to forbid client-side scripts from reading the cookie. Set the 'HttpOnly' flag by calling 'cookie.setHttpOnly(true);'"},"helpUri":"https://find-sec-bugs.github.io/bugs.htm#HTTPONLY_COOKIE","id":"tmp.claude-0.-home-claude.371873cd-092c-50ef-8516-a10e1ffe3502.scratchpad.semgrep-rules-dl.rules.java.lang.security.audit.cookie-missing-httponly","name":"tmp.claude-0.-home-claude.371873cd-092c-50ef-8516-a10e1ffe3502.scratchpad.semgrep-rules-dl.rules.java.lang.security.audit.cookie-missing-httponly","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":["CWE-1004: Sensitive Cookie Without 'HttpOnly' Flag","LOW CONFIDENCE","OWASP-A02:2025 - Security Misconfiguration","OWASP-A05:2021 - Security Misconfiguration","security"]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Semgrep Finding: tmp.claude-0.-home-claude.371873cd-092c-50ef-8516-a10e1ffe3502.scratchpad.semgrep-rules-dl.rules.java.lang.security.audit.cookie-missing-httponly"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"fullDescription":{"text":"A cookie was detected without setting the 'secure' flag. The 'secure' flag for cookies prevents the client from transmitting the cookie over insecure channels such as HTTP. Set the 'secure' flag by calling '$COOKIE.setSecure(true);'"},"help":{"markdown":"A cookie was detected without setting the 'secure' flag. The 'secure' flag for cookies prevents the client from transmitting the cookie over insecure channels such as HTTP. Set the 'secure' flag by calling '$COOKIE.setSecure(true);'\n\n<b>References:</b>\n - [Semgrep Rule](https://find-sec-bugs.github.io/bugs.htm#INSECURE_COOKIE)\n - [https://owasp.org/